    "d710b835e16e2e5344d01b18dfad5382da412a319db88db000851b3a22dc3347": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "4fc2fce3c5e7a78b085e1a4ef1667e114ad9a42e8d23ed6dd03e41c8f9ce3695",
      "contextFingerprint": "bad096f43456c50827eaefc04902fd9cf7556fe3d4f136079067f9fa75622c61",
      "sourceText": "| 场景 | 推荐写法 | 原因 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 局部变量类型很明显 | `auto x = expr;` | 少写重复类型 |\n| 只读遍历大对象 | `const auto& x` | 避免拷贝，同时不允许修改 |\n| 要修改原对象 | `auto& x` | 明确拿到引用 |\n| 可能为空的指针 | `auto* p = get();` | 让读者一眼看出这是指针 |\n| 函数返回引用且必须保留引用 | `decltype(auto)` | `auto` 返回值会丢失引用 |\n| 类型本身是业务含义 | 显式类型 | 例如 `Meter distance = ...` 比 `auto distance` 更清楚 |",
      "translatedText": "| Scenario | Recommended写法 | Reason |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Local variable type is obvious | `auto x = expr;` | Avoid repeating the type |\n| Read\\-only traversal of large objects | `const auto& x` | Avoid copying while disallowing modification |\n| Need to modify the original object | `auto& x` | Explicitly obtain a reference |\n| Pointer that may be null | `auto* p = get();` | Let readers see at a glance that this is a pointer |\n| Function returns a reference and the reference must be preserved | `decltype(auto)` | `auto` The return value will lose the reference |\n| The type itself carries business meaning | Explicit type | For example `Meter distance = ...` than `auto distance` is clearer |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 212,
        "outputTokens": 109,
        "costUsd": 0.000195
      }
    },
