      "contextFingerprint": "00c76a938da2155dbc620c6283657fc33ee136f0f356e8146ab6dfed01662baf",
      "sourceText": "因此 `decayTime=0.5` 是更新时检查的年龄阈值，不是点到0.5秒就立刻消失。稀疏缓存格可能等到时间更新门槛才重新检查；没有新点云时，这段处理不会执行。增大衰减时间有利于保留地面样本，也可能延长旧物体残留；减小则需观察稀疏格是否出现空洞。",
      "translatedText": "Therefore, `decayTime=0.5` is the age threshold checked during updates, not something that disappears immediately when it reaches 0\\.5 seconds\\. A sparse cache cell may wait until the time update threshold before being rechecked; when there is no new point cloud, this processing will not execute\\. Increasing the decay time helps retain ground samples, but may also prolong the residual presence of old objects; if decreased, it is necessary to observe whether holes appear in sparse cells\\.",
